   630|- kind must be "replace_exact" (replace oldText with newText) or "create_file" (new file).
   631|- oldText must be an EXACT substring of the file content (copy it verbatim from the FILE CONTENTS above).
   632|- For replace_exact: copy a UNIQUE 20-80 character snippet from the target file as oldText. Do NOT use the entire file as oldText.
